Third-party attribution

The Waves LV1 wire protocol implemented in lv1_fetch.js (zDNS multicast
discovery, the OSC-over-TCP framing, the MyFOH-style handshake and the
/Channels, /Notify/Meters and /Notify/TrackColor message layouts) was
reverse-engineered by the bitfocus/companion-module-waves-lv1 project, also
MIT licensed:

    https://github.com/bitfocus/companion-module-waves-lv1
    Copyright (c) Bitfocus AS and contributors

This project reimplements that protocol independently in dependency-free
Node.js; no source code was copied.

Waves and LV1 are trademarks of Waves Audio Ltd. REAPER is a trademark of
Cockos Incorporated. This project is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or
supported by either company.
